In `gearCharge`, a loan with any boat keys missing now pays one boat key's cost in total, and a loan with none missing pays nothing for them. Each damaged lifejacket is charged its full cost. Everything else is charged as before, and the loan is still not changed.

I assumed a loan has at most one boat key line. If it can have several, each line would be charged its own lock change.
